# Example 7: Nitrogen Reactor Setup in 3D with assumed electrons density resembling Altin 2024
# On a weak laptop (-np 4), does not have enough memory for 64^3 points, with 32^3 should take less than 1 minute
# On a ludwigb (-np 32), should take less than 3 minutes

Start(HARPS)

  Start(Grid)
    Nx                      =   64
    Ny                      =   64
    Nz                      =   64
    
    LengthX                 =   0.08636           # [m]
    LengthY                 =   0.12200           # [m]
    LengthZ                 =   0.07500           # [m]

    RefinementFactorX       =   6
    x_BL                    =   0.023            # [m]
    x_RL                    =   0.031            # [m]
    x_RR                    =   0.055            # [m]
    x_BR                    =   0.063            # [m]

    RefinementFactorY       =   6
    y_BL                    =   0.041            # [m]
    y_RL                    =   0.049            # [m]
    y_RR                    =   0.073            # [m]
    y_BR                    =   0.081            # [m]

    #RefinementFactorZ       =   2
    #z_BL                    =   0.015            # [m]
    #z_RL                    =   0.022            # [m]
    #z_RR                    =   0.043            # [m]
    #z_BR                    =   0.050            # [m]
  End(Grid)

  Start(PhysicalParameters)
    RealPermittivity          =   1.0             # [no units, relative quantity]
    Frequency                 =   2.45E9          # [Hz]
    RealMobility              =   0.8             # [m^2/(V s)]
    ImagMobility              =   -2.5            # [m^2/(V s)]
    ElectronDensity           =   1E11            # [m^-3]
    RealPermittivityLocations =   input/example7_permittivity_points.dat   # Indice of points with different real Permitivity
    RealPermittivityValues    =   input/example7_permittivity_values.dat   # Different values of real Permitivity
    ElectronDensityLocations  =   input/example7_elec_dens_points.dat      # Indice of points with different electron density
    ElectronDensityValues     =   input/example7_elec_dens_values.dat      # Different values of electron density
  End(PhysicalParameters)

  Start(Solver)
    Method                  =   direct_LU          # Options: direct_LU, BICGSTAB, GMRES
    PC                      =   bjacobi           # Pre conditioner: bjacobi, asm, gamg, sor, jacobi, mg, hypre (-np 1), ilu (-np 1), none
    Scalar                  =   -1                 # -1 for vector problem (0 for Ex, 1 for Ey, 2 for Ez)
    Tolerance               =   1.0E-7            # For iterative solvers
    MaxIterations           =   10000             # For iterative solvers
    #InitialGuessFile        =   Outputs/fields_solution_direct7.bin
  End(Solver)

  Start(BoundaryConditions)
    X_lower_Boundary        =   PerfectConductor
    X_upper_Boundary        =   PerfectConductor
    Y_lower_Boundary        =   Homogeneous
    Y_upper_Boundary        =   PerfectConductor
    Z_lower_Boundary        =   Homogeneous
    Z_upper_Boundary        =   Homogeneous

    # Source (oscilating charge)
    SourceLocations      =   input/example7_excitation_points.dat
    SourceValues         =   input/example7_excitation_values.dat
    #ExcitationLocations      =   input/example7_excitation_points.dat
    #ExcitationValues         =   input/example7_excitation_values.dat

    # Excitation (fixing amplitudes in a region)

    MetalLocations          =   input/example7_metal_points.dat 
  End(BoundaryConditions)

  Start(PML)                                      # Perfectly Matched Layer
    Enable_X_lower        =   False
    Enable_X_upper        =   False
    Enable_Y_lower        =   True
    Y_lower_Layers        =   12
    Enable_Y_upper        =   False
    Y_upper_Layers        =   12
    Enable_Z_lower        =   True
    Z_lower_Layers        =   12
    Enable_Z_upper        =   True
    Z_upper_Layers        =   12

    Order                 =   5
    Sigma_0               =   0.8
  End(PML)

  Start(Output)
    PrintMatrix         =   False
    PrintProgress       =   True
    PrintGrid           =   False
    PrintSolution       =   False
    StoreResults        =   True
    PrintConfig         =   False
    OutputDirectory     =   Outputs/
    Fields              =   AbsorbedPower, FieldAmplitudes, FieldRealPart, FieldComponents, F_Grad_Components, PowerFlux, Inputs
  End(Output)

End(HARPS)